{"id":"58ecf14d03c70b88","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-suslin-hypothesis.md","title":"Suslin Hypothesis","display":"df-suslin-hypothesis — Suslin Hypothesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-suslin-hypothesis","aliases":["58-df-suslin-hypothesis"],"display":"df-suslin-hypothesis — Suslin Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-suslin-hypothesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-suslin-hypothesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-suslin-hypothesis — Suslin Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SuslinTree}\">\\(\\operatorname{SuslinTree}\\)</span> (二元 Suslin 树谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SH}\">\\(\\mathrm{SH}\\)</span> (本文件定义的 Suslin 假设)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SH}\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists T,&lt;_{T}\\;\\operatorname{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_{T})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SH}\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists T,&lt;_{T}\\;\\operatorname{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_{T})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>线序表述是“不存在不可分的完备稠密 c.c.c. 无端点线序（Suslin 线）”，不是“每个 c.c.c. 线序都与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 同构”。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SH}\">\\(\\mathrm{SH}\\)</span> is independent of ZFC.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SH}\">\\(\\mathrm{SH}\\)</span> is equivalent, in the tree formulation, to the nonexistence of Suslin trees.</li>\n<li>具体迫使是否保留或消灭 Suslin 树需要单独假设与证明，不作为定义备注中的无条件断言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SuslinTree}$ (二元 Suslin 树谓词, see [[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SuslinTree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SH}\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists T,<_{T}\\;\\operatorname{SuslinTree}(T,<_{T})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SH}","display":false}],"bytes":1051,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-suslin-hypothesis.md|58-df-suslin-hypothesis]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["47ecd1e17d0a4400"]}